  "ingredients": [
    "1 medium head garlic, top of bulbs trimmed off so tops of cloves are exposed",
    "1 tablespoon olive oil",
    "2 pounds russet potatoes, peeled and quartered",
    "4 tablespoons butter, softened",
    "0.5 cup milk",
    "salt and pepper to taste"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients. Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/yHw3K08_Uvz5Q2j5vyI6RbZhhWc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/24775-roasted-garlic-mashed-potatoes-VAT-step-01-9d27cb43c9a94b768e802cb28336507f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/24775/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Drizzle olive oil over garlic head; wrap in aluminum foil.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/6IC5U3_7Rru5Zq0mbRp0fvBLy8s=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/24775-roasted-garlic-mashed-potatoes-VAT-step-02-4d3e5a1a239941ed99ead86f4ac9a539.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/24775/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until cloves are soft and golden, about 1 hour.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/52isogYalKZWLTjERsJepCc-mVc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/24775-roasted-garlic-mashed-potatoes-VAT-step-03-b7840945c62846f7b3eaa0d0b776e89d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/24775/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "When the garlic has baked for about 35 minutes, bring a large pot of salted water to a boil. Add potatoes and cook until tender, about 15 minutes. Drain and let cool for a few minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/qq3oFHwqc0TnsLdAFZldgNUTUMI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/24775-roasted-garlic-mashed-potatoes-VAT-step-04-3f219167898b49a1a8b60c9c66509457.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/24775/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Return potatoes to the pot or place in a large mixing bowl. Add milk, butter, salt, and pepper.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/P5dxmglhQhjpPc_uj4pXAZd404M=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/24775-roasted-garlic-mashed-potatoes-VAT-step-05-ca30a9766e5443fea6d0b79bf62eb5a9.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/24775/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove garlic from the oven. Cut garlic head in half and squeeze softened cloves into potato mixture.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Rx_b52pje0OkpnHLzcvEzLqqHCE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/24775-roasted-garlic-mashed-potatoes-VAT-step-06-8ae675f90f1046ec821c2b6108addee0.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/24775/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Beat with an electric mixer until smooth and creamy, or to desired consistency.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/psnDXBHiimS125tvgC8kHBFSw3w=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/24775-roasted-garlic-mashed-potatoes-VAT-step-07-40bc8da1e1a8425ebf404f6c1468398a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/24775/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve and enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Zyop_MV_0neBLfJRUSS7qJesgsM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/24775-roasted-garlic-mashed-potatoes-VAT-Beauty-4x3-75f7986c481648568a2438d60110883a.jpg"
